# The first-use bomb prompt (Paul's playtest, 2026-11-17: he could not find how to bomb with the
# keyboard; unit tests: testHint*). Flying left in the cannon stance towards a closed barracks, the
# game says how to get to the bombs: HOLD DOWN, THEN FIRE: BOMB, and a second later the other
# way, BTN 2, THEN FIRE: BOMB. In the bomb stance it says what fire and up+fire do.
wait-serial "AGK t0" 1000
press fire 2
wait 125
press up 30
hold left
wait-serial "AGK hint=bomb" 600
wait 30
screenshot hint
# the line is typed by now: the left stem of its H, in the message pen (cream, 0xFEC)
expect-color hint 57 99 0xFEC
wait 45
screenshot hint2
# the other wording: the left stem of the B of BTN 2
expect-color hint2 73 99 0xFEC
release
press fire2 1
wait 30
expect-serial "AGK hint=stance"
screenshot stance
# FIRE: BOMB   UP AND FIRE: GUNS, the F
expect-color stance 41 99 0xFEC
expect-no-serial "AGK ERR"
expect-no-dropped-frames
